ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa061: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing 12 ribbon-thin ADVANCED_FACEs on PLANE; each face 0.001 mm wide (Y) x 100 mm long (X); faces stacked in Y at 0.001 mm intervals (y=0..0.001, 0.001..0.002, ..., 0.011..0.012); vertex (0.0,0.001,0.0) at first row boundary; vertex (100.0,0.001,0.0) at far end of first row; vertex (0.0,0.01,0.0) at tenth row boundary; adjacent faces share long edges — sewing seam-edge creation blows up quadratically; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; no orphaned entities */
HEADER;
